	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nADCRANGE = 1 (+- 40.96 mV range)\nV_{SENSE} = 5A x 0.008  = 40 mV. This utilizes 97.6% of the ADC range, providing the highest possible resolution.\nPower Dissipation: P = 5² x 0.008 = 0.2W\n"
